      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What are the Benefits of a LAN?",
      "fontSize": 23.679998779296874,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What are the Benefits of a LAN?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3XK1sI9W2WnJ8zwWqgrtA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 357.6101989746094,
      "y": 1140.1000366210938,
      "width": 767.3795776367186,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 992731496,
      "version": 221,
      "versionNonce": 1638939496,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788872208976,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Fast Data Sharing: LANs allow connected devices, like computers and printers,\nto share files and resources quickly. Whether you're sending documents,\nstreaming videos, or accessing shared drives, LAN speeds make everything\nfaster and more efficient.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Fast Data Sharing: LANs allow connected devices, like computers and printers, to share files and resources quickly. Whether you're sending documents, streaming videos, or accessing shared drives, LAN speeds make everything faster and more efficient.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PoQMmmW7COIFLQXQ9QfLX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 358.0802001953125,
      "y": 1260.4000854492188,
      "width": 736.4396362304689,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 505758488,
      "version": 130,
      "versionNonce": 201625880,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788872251498,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Cost-Effective: Once set up, a LAN reduces the need for extra devices or\nduplicate resources.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Cost-Effective: Once set up, a LAN reduces the need for extra devices or duplicate resources.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ww6ZW-PmQj2bUoeFft2-Z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 362.07037353515625,
      "y": 1328.4000549316406,
      "width": 798.8594360351562,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 442901864,
      "version": 224,
      "versionNonce": 1888990744,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788872578444,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Enhanced Security: Since a LAN is a private network, it’s easier to control access\nand keep unauthorized users out. You can implement security measures like\nfirewalls and passwords to protect sensitive data.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Enhanced Security: Since a LAN is a private network, it’s easier to control access and keep unauthorized users out. You can implement security measures like firewalls and passwords to protect sensitive data.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
