      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788873359133,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MAN can serve multiple users at a time with the same high-speed internet\nto all the users.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MAN can serve multiple users at a time with the same high-speed internet to all the users.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "G6PE2yIXQ6LqDx00KS3eo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 385.7102355957031,
      "y": 2212.1000061035156,
      "width": 730.3796997070312,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1478451560,
      "version": 163,
      "versionNonce": 317960040,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788873367259,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MAN allows for centralized management and control of the network, making\nit easier to monitor and manage network resources and security.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MAN allows for centralized management and control of the network, making it easier to monitor and manage network resources and security.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "JySv60iu7s62Dvpqf_HZr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 397.1102600097656,
      "y": 2384.5999755859375,
      "width": 740.7796020507812,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1689275416,
      "version": 158,
      "versionNonce": 340300568,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788873441820,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "It is a computer network that covers a large geographical area consisting\nof two or more LANs or MANs.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "It is a computer network that covers a large geographical area consisting of two or more LANs or MANs.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yACywIUGDwt5AogC6Kxup",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 398.07007598876953,
      "y": 2449.8999938964844,
      "width": 277.0185600682349,
      "height": 36.40002441406251,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 189268840,
      "version": 137,
      "versionNonce": 1324139800,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788873717284,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Advantages of WAN",
      "fontSize": 29.120019531250012,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Advantages of WAN",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ngzGyzjDxY9Nfoqn5XiBC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 402.0602111816406,
      "y": 2511.6000061035156,
      "width": 768.4795532226561,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 800737048,
      "version": 188,
      "versionNonce": 196274792,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788873730180,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "It covers large geographical area which enhances the reach of organisation to\ntransmit data quickly and cheaply.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "It covers large geographical area which enhances the reach of organisation to transmit data quickly and cheaply.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ci8zBZ62VGqikz_6IiVpE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 402.7201843261719,
      "y": 2579.5999755859375,
      "width": 558.5595703125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1967347304,
      "version": 99,
      "versionNonce": 623594856,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788873721909,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The data can be stored in centralised manner because of\nremote access to data provided by WAN.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The data can be stored in centralised manner because of remote access to data provided by WAN.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Uh_mGN31EvJ4Kp3zWwDyC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 414.60015869140625,
      "y": 2683.5999450683594,
      "width": 606.7996215820312,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1947313176,
      "version": 90,
      "versionNonce": 1428319256,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788873725522,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The travel charges that are needed to cover the geographical\narea of work can be minimised.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The travel charges that are needed to cover the geographical area of work can be minimised.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YNDjEQ-MZ5KRjCZ8Cq0Hj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 411.5201721191406,
      "y": 2749.5,
      "width": 603.359619140625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1247562088,
      "version": 87,
      "versionNonce": 1951369496,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788873724038,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WAN enables a user or organisation to connect with the world\nvery easily and allows to exchange data and do business at\nglobal level.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WAN enables a user or organisation to connect with the world very easily and allows to exchange data and do business at global level.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "c0pZE0muTtDBZB_fMrFe2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 408.69007873535156,
      "y": 2949.1000061035156,
      "width": 464.82051025390626,
      "height": 46.00000000000002,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 566264856,
      "version": 61,
      "versionNonce": 1652304232,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788874660475,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The OSI Reference Model",
